          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While a friendly ^^**War Dog^^** model is within 9&quot; of this model, improve that ^^**War Dog^^** model&apos;s Leadership  and Objective Control characteristics by 1.</characteristic>
