          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Each time this model makes an attack that targets a ^^**Monster^^** or ^^**Vehicle^^** unit, add 1 to the Hit roll. If that target is ^^**Titanic^^** or ^^**Towering^^**, add 1 to the Wound roll as well.</characteristic>
