            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of the first battle round, select one unit from your opponent&apos;s army to be this model&apos;s victim. Each time this model makes an attack that targets its victim, you can re-roll the Wound roll. Each time this model&apos;s victim is destroyed, select one new enemy unit to be this model&apos;s victim.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Close-range Killers (Aura)" id="31ed-3d34-0d2b-60d2" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While a friendly ^^**War Dog^^** model is within 9&quot; of this model, each time that ^^**War Dog^^** model makes an attack that targets the closest enemy unit, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
